            <ArticleTitle>[Problems connected with sexual activity in patients with heart disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>151-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper presents some basic data on sexual activity in patients with heart disease. The most typical problems of people with stable angina or after myocardial infarction connected with sexual intercourse have been presented. Modulation of risk of heart attack during sexual activity and main problems of sexual dysfunction after acute coronary syndromes have been described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
